  "invariants": [
    "One (docType, subject, snapshotHash, version) produces at most one issued document.",
    "Issued bytes are never modified; corrections supersede with links (UNB-UI-S-007 'Superseded by').",
    "Every document has exactly one retention class at creation; effective retention is the maximum of all applicable periods and holds.",
    "No deletion without an approved class-level batch and an immediate re-check of policy, hold and dependency versions; no automatic deletion.",
    "Provider acceptance is never shown as delivery."
  ]
